{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13683","headline":"上古之什补亡训传十三章 · 顾况","name":"上古之什补亡训传十三章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐哉上古，生弃与柱。\n句龙是生，乃有甫田。\n惟彼甫田，有万斯年。\n开利之源，无乃塞源。\n一廛亦官，百廛亦官。\n啬夫孔艰，浸兮暵兮，申有螽兮。\n惟馨祀是患，岂止馁与寒。\n啬夫咨咨，䅎盛苗衰。\n耕之耰之，襏襫锄犂。\n手胼足胝，水之蛭螾。\n吮喋我肌，我姑自思。\n胡不奋飞，东人利百。\n西人利百，有匪我心。\n胡爲不易，河水活活。\n万人逐末，俾尔之愉悦兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}